Third-party notices — myne-themes
==================================

This repository bundles a small set of themes that are faithful ports of
well-known, community color schemes. A Myne theme is a JSON map of *Myne's own*
design tokens (`--paper`, `--ink-*`, `--accent`, …) to color values; a port
reproduces an upstream scheme's palette in that map. It copies no upstream code,
token names, or files — only the color values, re-expressed into Myne's schema.

The ports below are redistributed under their upstream license (not relicensed),
with credit to the original author and a link to the source, as declared in each
theme's `themes/<slug>/meta.json`. See `LICENSING.md` for the subtree split. The
original Myne themes (`nocturne`, `warm-paper`) are the contributor's own work
under CC-BY-4.0 and are not listed here.


